<title>ANDORRA: CYCLING-GERMANY'S ULLRICH WINS TOUR DE FRANCE 10TH STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GERMANY'S ULLRICH WINS TOUR DE FRANCE 10TH STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>ARCALIS, Andorra 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany won the 252.5-km 10th stage of the Tour de France from Luchon to Andorra on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Ullrich took the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
